message: "If you use this replication package, please cite the paper below."
title: "The Samata Latch — Replication Package (Toy Arc)"
abstract: >-
  From-scratch numpy toy experiments (exp01–exp08) reproducing the constructive
  toy-scale result of "The Samata Latch: Designed Internal State for In-Context
  Binding Integrity": a write-once latch with symbolic readout that holds zero
  breaches across 72 injection cells in 3/3 seeds at 4.4–8.8x less training.
